{"id":"1212025633f2b50c","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-feller-process.md","title":"Feller Process","display":"df-feller-process — Feller Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-feller-process","aliases":["58-df-feller-process"],"display":"df-feller-process — Feller Process","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-feller-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-feller-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-feller-process — Feller Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c6a1de6afbc3124\" href=\"?note=6c6a1de6afbc3124\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md\">../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f7bd646c95b0642\" href=\"?note=2f7bd646c95b0642\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md\">../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52ad543842bcb570\" href=\"?note=52ad543842bcb570\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MarkovProcess}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{MarkovProcess}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c6a1de6afbc3124\" href=\"?note=6c6a1de6afbc3124\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md\">../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,E,\\tau_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,E,\\tau_E)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2f7bd646c95b0642\" href=\"?note=2f7bd646c95b0642\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md\">../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CondExp}_S(Y,Z,\\mathcal H,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CondExp}_S(Y,Z,\\mathcal H,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52ad543842bcb570\" href=\"?note=52ad543842bcb570\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md\">../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitionSemigroupOf}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitionSemigroupOf}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md\">../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}of}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{TransitionSemigroupOf}_S(P,X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E):\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,E)\\land\\tau_E\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s+t\\in T\\to\\forall g\\in C_0(E,\\tau_E)\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\mathrm{CondExp}_S(Y,g\\circ X(s+t),\\{\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(s)(\\omega)\\in A\\}:A\\in\\mathcal E\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y(\\omega)\\neq P(t)(g)(X(s)(\\omega))\\})=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transition\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}of}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{TransitionSemigroupOf}_S(P,X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,E,\\tau_E)\n\\land T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathcal E=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E):\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,E)\\land\\tau_E\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s+t\\in T\\to\\forall g\\in C_0(E,\\tau_E)\\;\\exists Y\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(\\mathrm{CondExp}_S(Y,g\\circ X(s+t),\\{\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(s)(\\omega)\\in A\\}:A\\in\\mathcal E\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:Y(\\omega)\\neq P(t)(g)(X(s)(\\omega))\\})=0\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}feller\\text{-}process}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{MarkovProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{TransitionSemigroupOf}_S(P,X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}feller\\text{-}process}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{FellerProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{MarkovProcess}_S(X,\\mathcal G,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{TransitionSemigroupOf}_S(P,X,T,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\tau_E).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The second predicate formally connects the operator semigroup to the conditional transition law of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; “induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>” is no longer carried only by prose.</li>\n<li>Feller processes have transitions preserving continuous functions that vanish at infinity.</li>\n<li>They model many diffusion processes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c6a1de6afbc3124","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"2f7bd646c95b0642","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"52ad543842bcb570","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"6c6a1de6afbc3124","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MarkovProcess}_S\\subseteq V^8$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-markov-process.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"2f7bd646c95b0642","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FellerSemigroup}_S(P,E,\\tau_E)$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-feller-semigroup.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"52ad543842bcb570","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CondExp}_S(Y,Z,\\mathcal H,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-conditional-expectation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-